{"id":124,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"The Jynx of Galar often have beautiful and delicate voices. Some of these Pokémon have even gathered a fan base."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"In certain parts of Galar, Jynx was once feared and worshiped as the Queen of Ice."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"Appears to move to a rhythm of its own, as if it were dancing. It wiggles its hips as it walks."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Its strange cries sound like human language. There are some musicians who compose songs for Jynx to sing."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It sways its hips to a rhythm all its own. The precise movements of Jynx living in Alola are truly wonderful."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Jynx walks rhythmically, swaying and shaking its hips as if it were dancing. Its motions are so bouncingly alluring, people seeing it are compelled to shake their hips without giving any thought to what they are doing."},{"games":["Y","FireRed"],"text":"It speaks using a language that sounds human. Research is under way to determine what is being said."},{"games":["X"],"text":"It wiggles its hips as it walks. It can cause people to dance in unison with it."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Its cries sound like human speech. However, it is impossible to tell what it is trying to say."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"It speaks a language similar to that of humans. However, it seems to use dancing to communicate."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"It rocks its body rhythmically. It appears to alter the rhythm depending on how it is feeling."},{"games":["LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"It seductively wiggles its hips as it walks. It can cause people to dance in unison with it."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A JYNX sashays rhythmically as if it were dancing. Its motions are so bouncingly alluring, people seeing it are compelled to shake their hips without noticing."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It has several different cry patterns, each of which seems to have its own meaning."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Oblivious","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is oblivious, keeping it from being infatuated, falling for taunts, or being affected by Intimidate."},{"name":"Forewarn","hidden":false,"description":"When it enters a battle, the Pokémon can tell one of the moves an opposing Pokémon has."},{"name":"Dry Skin","hidden":true,"description":"Restores the Pokémon's HP in rain or when it is hit by Water-type moves. Reduces HP in harsh sunlight, and increases the damage received from Fire-type moves."}],"eggGroups":["Human-Like"],"genderRate":8,"hatchCounter":25,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"urban","color":"Red","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":238,"name":"Smoochum","condition":null,"children":[{"id":124,"name":"Jynx","condition":"Lv. 30","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,1],[1,122],[1,181],[1,186],[1,383],[12,93],[16,343],[20,47],[24,313],[28,8],[34,94],[40,142],[46,212],[52,195],[58,59]],"machine":[502,213,419,59,34,280,347,204,409,577,227,203,412,263,313,374,411,248,416,447,258,270,63,304,58,8,333,196,113,478,25,5,118,417,371,182,94,678,427,473,240,115,156,496,247,285,214,173,500,164,269,168,271,433,253,472,428],"egg":[],"tutor":[797,813]},"cards":[{"id":"me5-32","name":"Jynx","set":"Pitch Black","date":"2026-07-17","rarity":"Common","number":"32","artist":"Yoshimoto Yoshimon","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me5-32/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me5-32/large"},{"id":"me1-57","name":"Jynx","set":"Mega Evolution","date":"2025-09-26","rarity":"Common","number":"57","artist":null,"img":"me1/57"},{"id":"sv6-46","name":"Jynx","set":"Twilight Masquerade","date":"2024-05-24","rarity":"Common","number":"46","artist":"Gapao","img":"sv6/46"},{"id":"sv3pt5-124","name":"Jynx ex","set":"151","date":"2023-09-22","rarity":"